<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Examples<sp/>{#examples}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>page<sp/>documents<sp/>the<sp/>`C`<sp/>versions<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>example<sp/>simulations<sp/>used<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>NDXL<sp/>publication,<sp/>together<sp/>illustrating<sp/>the<sp/>capabilities<sp/>of<sp/>NDXL.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">For<sp/>a<sp/>brief<sp/>introductory<sp/>example<sp/>using<sp/>the<sp/>Kuramoto<sp/>model,<sp/>see<sp/>the<sp/>&lt;b&gt;[NDXL<sp/>source<sp/>repository](https://github.com/NonlinearC/NDXL/tree/main/NDXL)&lt;/b&gt;.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>recommend<sp/>reading<sp/>through<sp/>the<sp/>@ref<sp/>installation<sp/>guide<sp/>before<sp/>writing<sp/>any<sp/>code,<sp/>as<sp/>this<sp/>section<sp/>assumes<sp/>a<sp/>similar<sp/>file<sp/>structure,<sp/>and<sp/>that<sp/>call<sp/>source<sp/>code<sp/>is<sp/>placed<sp/>in<sp/>`main.c`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>also<sp/>strongly<sp/>recommend<sp/>first<sp/>reading<sp/>through<sp/>the<sp/>@ref<sp/>concepts<sp/>page,<sp/>as<sp/>we<sp/>will<sp/>assume<sp/>you<sp/>are<sp/>familiar<sp/>with<sp/>the<sp/>network<sp/>dynamics-specific<sp/>terminology.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\note<sp/>This<sp/>is<sp/>NOT<sp/>a<sp/>replacement<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>&lt;b&gt;[API<sp/>documentation](topics.html)&lt;/b&gt;,<sp/>which<sp/>provides<sp/>detailed<sp/>explanations<sp/>on<sp/>functions,<sp/>objects,<sp/>and<sp/>typedefs<sp/>used.<sp/>The<sp/>sections<sp/>should<sp/>be<sp/>absorbed<sp/>in<sp/>tandem.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Getting<sp/>Started</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">All<sp/>NDXL<sp/>programs<sp/>&lt;b&gt;MUST&lt;/b&gt;<sp/>call<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxlInit()<sp/>before<sp/>any<sp/>NDXL<sp/>functionality.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>function<sp/>initialises<sp/>crucial<sp/>internal<sp/>variables,<sp/>and<sp/>registers<sp/>garbage<sp/>collection<sp/>functions<sp/>that<sp/>automatically<sp/>and<sp/>safely<sp/>release<sp/>any<sp/>remaining<sp/>NDXL<sp/>objects<sp/>when<sp/>the<sp/>program<sp/>terminates.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\warning<sp/>The<sp/>garbage<sp/>collection<sp/>in<sp/>NDXL<sp/>handles<sp/>&lt;b&gt;only&lt;/b&gt;<sp/>memory<sp/>allocated<sp/>by<sp/>NDXL.<sp/>Any<sp/>memory<sp/>alloctaed<sp/>by<sp/>the<sp/>user<sp/>using<sp/>e.g.,<sp/>`malloc()`,<sp/>`calloc()`,<sp/>`realloc()`,<sp/>must<sp/>still<sp/>be<sp/>manually<sp/>released<sp/>by<sp/>the<sp/>user<sp/>using<sp/>`free()`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>core<sp/>object<sp/>in<sp/>NDXL<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxl_network<sp/>NDXLNetwork,<sp/>which<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>(initially<sp/>empty)<sp/>host<sp/>object<sp/>for<sp/>creating<sp/>vertices,<sp/>edges,<sp/>and<sp/>noise<sp/>channels,<sp/>and<sp/>which<sp/>later<sp/>becomes<sp/>the<sp/>target<sp/>of<sp/>@ref<sp/>network_simulation<sp/>&quot;simulation&quot;<sp/>functions.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>will<sp/>start<sp/>by<sp/>defining<sp/>an<sp/>empty<sp/>network<sp/>using<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxlCreateNetwork(),<sp/>which<sp/>takes<sp/>in<sp/>a<sp/>single<sp/>parameter,<sp/>a<sp/>`void*`<sp/>containing<sp/>any<sp/>extra<sp/>data<sp/>we<sp/>want<sp/>the<sp/>network<sp/>to<sp/>use.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>will<sp/>pass<sp/>`0`<sp/>for<sp/>now,<sp/>since<sp/>we<sp/>do<sp/>not<sp/>yet<sp/>have<sp/>any<sp/>data<sp/>the<sp/>network<sp/>should<sp/>rely<sp/>on.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#include<sp/>&quot;../include/ndxl.h&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlInit();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NDXLNetwork*<sp/>nwk<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlCreateNetwork(0);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>now<sp/>need<sp/>to<sp/>populate<sp/>`nwk`<sp/>with<sp/>some<sp/>vertices,<sp/>so<sp/>that<sp/>we<sp/>have<sp/>components<sp/>to<sp/>simulate.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Each<sp/>vertex<sp/>needs<sp/>a<sp/>@ref<sp/>NDXLVertexDynamics<sp/>&quot;dynamics<sp/>function&quot;<sp/>that<sp/>describes<sp/>how<sp/>its<sp/>state<sp/>vector<sp/>evolves<sp/>over<sp/>time<sp/>\f$t\f$,<sp/>expressed<sp/>as<sp/>a<sp/>time<sp/>ordinary<sp/>differential<sp/>equations<sp/>(ODE).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">For<sp/>example,<sp/>if<sp/>we<sp/>want<sp/>a<sp/>vertex<sp/>wtih<sp/>state<sp/>vector<sp/>\f$\vec{x}\f$<sp/>to<sp/>evolve<sp/>according<sp/>to</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f[</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\frac{d\vec{x}}{dt}<sp/>=<sp/>A\vec{x}t</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">where<sp/>\f$A\f$<sp/>is<sp/>some<sp/>constant,<sp/>and<sp/>\f$\vec{x}\f$<sp/>has<sp/>one<sp/>element<sp/>(is<sp/>a<sp/>scalar),<sp/>then<sp/>in<sp/>NDXL<sp/>we<sp/>write:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#include<sp/>&quot;../include/ndxl.h&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>dynamics(NDXLVertex*<sp/>vertex,<sp/>double*<sp/>dx,<sp/>const<sp/>double*<sp/>x,<sp/>double<sp/>t,<sp/>void*<sp/>params)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>A<sp/>=<sp/>*(double*)params;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dx[0]<sp/>=<sp/>A<sp/>*<sp/>x[0]<sp/>*<sp/>t;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\note<sp/>The<sp/>`//...`<sp/>comments<sp/>are<sp/>used<sp/>to<sp/>indicate<sp/>&quot;same<sp/>as<sp/>before&quot;.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">In<sp/>our<sp/>function,<sp/>we<sp/>exctract<sp/>\f$A\f$<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>user-defined<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`<sp/>that<sp/>we<sp/>will<sp/>pass<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>vertex<sp/>constructor,<sp/>and<sp/>we<sp/>write<sp/>the<sp/>differential<sp/>equation<sp/>in-place<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>output<sp/>vector<sp/>`dx`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">In<sp/>`main()`,<sp/>we<sp/>can<sp/>now<sp/>create<sp/>the<sp/>vertex,<sp/>baring<sp/>in<sp/>mind<sp/>that<sp/>whatever<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`<sp/>points<sp/>to<sp/>must<sp/>persist<sp/>in<sp/>memory<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>lifetime<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>vertex,<sp/>as<sp/>NDXL<sp/>does<sp/>not<sp/>copy<sp/>these<sp/>data.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#include<sp/>&quot;../include/ndxl.h&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlInit();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NDXLNetwork*<sp/>nwk<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlCreateNetwork(0);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Create<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`<sp/>A,<sp/>and<sp/>initial<sp/>conditions<sp/>x0</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>A<sp/>=<sp/>2.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>x0<sp/>=<sp/>1.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Create<sp/>vertex<sp/>on<sp/>`nwk`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NDXLVertex*<sp/>vert<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlCreateVertex(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>nwk,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Host<sp/>network</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>&amp;x0,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Initial<sp/>state<sp/>vector<sp/>-<sp/>must<sp/>be<sp/>a<sp/>pointer<sp/>to<sp/>double</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>1,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Length<sp/>of<sp/>state<sp/>vector</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dynamics,<sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Dynamics<sp/>function<sp/>the<sp/>vertex<sp/>state<sp/>must<sp/>evolve<sp/>according<sp/>to</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NULL,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>No<sp/>noise<sp/>function<sp/>(see<sp/>@ref<sp/>sde)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NULL,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>No<sp/>noise<sp/>channels<sp/>(must<sp/>be<sp/>NULL<sp/>if<sp/>noise<sp/>function<sp/>is<sp/>NULL)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>0,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Number<sp/>of<sp/>noise<sp/>channels<sp/>(must<sp/>be<sp/>0<sp/>if<sp/>noise<sp/>function<sp/>is<sp/>NULL)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NULL,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>No<sp/>discrete<sp/>callback</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>&amp;A<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>User-defined<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>could<sp/>now<sp/>simulate<sp/>`nwk`,<sp/>but<sp/>we<sp/>have<sp/>no<sp/>way<sp/>of<sp/>retrieving<sp/>the<sp/>simulated<sp/>outputs,<sp/>as<sp/>NDXL<sp/>does<sp/>not<sp/>automatically<sp/>store<sp/>these.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">To<sp/>capture<sp/>simulation<sp/>output,<sp/>we<sp/>use<sp/>a<sp/>@ref<sp/>network_callbacks<sp/>&quot;discrete<sp/>callback&quot;<sp/>that<sp/>operates<sp/>on<sp/>the<sp/>network<sp/>object.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Here,<sp/>we<sp/>will<sp/>write<sp/>the<sp/>state<sp/>vector<sp/>of<sp/>`vert`<sp/>out<sp/>to<sp/>a<sp/>CSV<sp/>file<sp/>at<sp/>each<sp/>evaluated<sp/>time<sp/>step.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#include<sp/>&lt;stdio.h&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#include<sp/>&quot;../include/ndxl.h&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>cb(NDXLNetwork*<sp/>net,<sp/>double<sp/>time,<sp/>void*<sp/>params)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>FILE*<sp/>csvfile<sp/>=<sp/>(FILE*)params;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NDXLVertex*<sp/>vertex<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlGetNetworkFirstVertex(net);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>x<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlVertexState(vertex)[0];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>fprintf(csvfile,<sp/>&quot;%f,%f\n&quot;,<sp/>time,<sp/>x);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Because<sp/>the<sp/>network<sp/>only<sp/>has<sp/>one<sp/>vertex,<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxlGetNetworkFirstVertex()<sp/>will<sp/>give<sp/>us<sp/>the<sp/>corresponding<sp/>@ref<sp/>NDXLVertex<sp/>pointer.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Since<sp/>this<sp/>pointer<sp/>is<sp/>shared,<sp/>we<sp/>do<sp/>not<sp/>need<sp/>to<sp/>(and<sp/>SHOULD<sp/>NOT)<sp/>release<sp/>the<sp/>associated<sp/>reosources<sp/>after<sp/>we<sp/>are<sp/>done<sp/>using<sp/>it.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Here,<sp/>the<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`<sp/>refers<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>parameters<sp/>pointer<sp/>associated<sp/>with<sp/>the<sp/>network,<sp/>which,<sp/>if<sp/>you&apos;ll<sp/>recall<sp/>from<sp/>earlier,<sp/>we<sp/>set<sp/>to<sp/>`0`!</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>therefore<sp/>need<sp/>to<sp/>modify<sp/>our<sp/>network<sp/>creation<sp/>to<sp/>have<sp/>the<sp/>output<sp/>file<sp/>as<sp/>its<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#include<sp/>&lt;stdio.h&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#include<sp/>&quot;../include/ndxl.h&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlInit();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Create<sp/>file<sp/>handle,<sp/>and<sp/>write<sp/>column<sp/>headers<sp/>if<sp/>successful</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>FILE*<sp/>f_output<sp/>=<sp/>fopen(&quot;states.csv&quot;,<sp/>&quot;w&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>(!f_output)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>1;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>fprintf(f_output,<sp/>&quot;t,x\n&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Assign<sp/>file<sp/>handle<sp/>to<sp/>network&apos;s<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NDXLNetwork*<sp/>nwk<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlCreateNetwork(f_output);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>fclose(f_output);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>are<sp/>now<sp/>ready<sp/>to<sp/>simulate<sp/>our<sp/>network<sp/>using<sp/>one<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>@ref<sp/>network_simulation<sp/>&quot;simulation&quot;<sp/>functions.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>will<sp/>use<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxlNetworkSimulateDopri,<sp/>which<sp/>uses<sp/>the<sp/>Dormand-Prince<sp/>Runge-Kutta<sp/>pair<sp/>of<sp/>order<sp/>5(4)<sp/>to<sp/>integrate<sp/>the<sp/>network<sp/>agents.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Integration<sp/>starts<sp/>at<sp/>the<sp/>network&apos;s<sp/>current<sp/>local<sp/>simulation<sp/>time,<sp/>which<sp/>is<sp/>set<sp/>to<sp/>`0`<sp/>by<sp/>default<sp/>when<sp/>we<sp/>created<sp/>the<sp/>network,<sp/>and<sp/>we<sp/>simply<sp/>specify<sp/>the<sp/>duration<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>simulation.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>can<sp/>also<sp/>verify<sp/>the<sp/>success<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>simulation<sp/>by<sp/>checking<sp/>against<sp/>@ref<sp/>NDXL_ERR.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#include<sp/>&lt;stdio.h&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#include<sp/>&quot;../include/ndxl.h&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlInit();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>int<sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlNetworkSimulateDopri(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>nwk,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Network<sp/>to<sp/>simulate</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>2.5,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Simulation<sp/>duration</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>1e-6,<sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Absolute<sp/>tolerance<sp/>(number<sp/>of<sp/>correct<sp/>decimal<sp/>places)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>1e-3,<sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Relative<sp/>tolerance<sp/>(number<sp/>of<sp/>correct<sp/>digits)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NULL,<sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Time-stops<sp/>array<sp/>(forced<sp/>evaluation<sp/>times)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>0,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Length<sp/>of<sp/>time-stops<sp/>array<sp/>(must<sp/>be<sp/>0<sp/>if<sp/>time-stops<sp/>is<sp/>NULL)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>cb<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Discrete<sp/>callback<sp/>(called<sp/>once<sp/>at<sp/>t<sp/>=<sp/>0,<sp/>then<sp/>again<sp/>after<sp/>each<sp/>successful<sp/>integration<sp/>step)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Verify<sp/>success</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>(result<sp/>==<sp/>NDXL_ERR)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlPrintError();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">If<sp/>the<sp/>network<sp/>successfully<sp/>simulates,<sp/>`states.csv`<sp/>will<sp/>contain<sp/>two<sp/>columns,<sp/>namely,<sp/>the<sp/>evaluated<sp/>times,<sp/>and<sp/>the<sp/>state<sp/>of<sp/>`vert`<sp/>at<sp/>those<sp/>times.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>can<sp/>compare<sp/>the<sp/>outputs<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>analytical<sp/>solution<sp/>of<sp/>our<sp/>dynamics<sp/>function,<sp/>which<sp/>is</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f[</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">x(t)<sp/>=<sp/>\exp{\left(\frac{A}{2}t^2\right)}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">given<sp/>that<sp/>\f$x(t=0)=1\f$.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>plot<sp/>the<sp/>analytical<sp/>and<sp/>numerical<sp/>solutions<sp/>using<sp/>a<sp/>plotting<sp/>library<sp/>like<sp/>&lt;b&gt;[matplotlib](https://matplotlib.org/)&lt;/b&gt;.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```python</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">import<sp/>matplotlib.pyplot<sp/>as<sp/>plt</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">import<sp/>numpy<sp/>as<sp/>np</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Do<sp/>not<sp/>parse<sp/>header<sp/>labels</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">t_num,<sp/>x_num<sp/>=<sp/>np.loadtxt(&quot;states.csv&quot;,<sp/>delimiter=&apos;,&apos;,<sp/>skiprows=1,<sp/>unpack=True)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Analyical<sp/>solution</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">t_ana<sp/>=<sp/>np.linspace(0.,<sp/>2.5,<sp/>50)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">x_ana<sp/>=<sp/>np.exp(t_ana**2)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Visualisation</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plt.plot(t_num,<sp/>x_num,<sp/>label=&quot;Numerical<sp/>solution&quot;)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plt.plot(t_ana,<sp/>x_ana,<sp/>ls=&apos;--&apos;,<sp/>label=&quot;Analytical<sp/>solution&quot;)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plt.xlabel(&quot;Time,<sp/>$t$&quot;)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plt.ylabel(&quot;$x=f(x,~t)$&quot;)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plt.legend(loc=&quot;upper<sp/>left&quot;)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plt.savefig(&quot;states.png&quot;,<sp/>bbox_inches=&apos;tight&apos;)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">![](@ref<sp/>states.png)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Congratulations!<sp/>You<sp/>have<sp/>successfully<sp/>set<sp/>up<sp/>and<sp/>simulated<sp/>your<sp/>first<sp/>network<sp/>in<sp/>NDXL.</highlight></codeline>
